      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why? Isn\u0027t it the other way around, i.e. on virtual unplug event, the device must be removed?\n\nWhich direction is the virtual unplug event generated? to the peripherals, or to the upper layers?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "cf03442fbbc52526fac2df54e2fe3bfd0aef7891",
