      "writtenOn": "2024-07-24T16:22:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The HID virtual unplug event is generated to inform HidHostService and apps that the HID device has been removed.\n\nApp requests HID VUP\n1. HID host sends VUP command to the HID device if connected and supported\n2. HID host disconnects if connected\n3. HID host removes the bond and HID info\n4. HID host generates HID VUP event\n\nApp removes bond\n1. Stack requests HID host to perform HID VUP\n2. HID host sends VUP command to the HID device if connected and supported\n3. HID host disconnects if connected\n4. HID host removes the bond and HID info\n5. HID host generates HID VUP event\n\nHID device sends HID VUP\n1. HID host disconnects if connected\n2. HID host removes the bond if required\n3. HID host generates HID VUP event\n\nStack removes the bond autonomously (stack has to ensure that related ACLs are disconnected before this)\n1. Stack requests HID host to remove HID information\n2. HID host removes HID info\n3. HID host generates HID VUP event",
      "parentUuid": "4cb34395_afcc0bae",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "cf03442fbbc52526fac2df54e2fe3bfd0aef7891",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
