      "writtenOn": "2024-07-24T06:45:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tangential topic: do you know why we don\u0027t just unconditionally call `BTA_DmRemoveDevice`? IIUC virtual unplug means removing the bonding information.",
