        "id": 1882530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-24T16:22:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "HID may not be the primary profile of some devices. For example, earbuds can support Android Dynamic Spatial Audio with A2DP over HID. A HID app must not disrupt the core A2DP functionality.",
      "parentUuid": "0ac3e519_141d332d",
